        <mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="1. The Admin opens the &quot;Reported tours&quot; page." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="2. The system returns tours with open reports, sorted by report count descending, flagged tours first, then oldest reports first (20 items per page). E1, E2." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="3. The Admin picks a tour." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="220" x="-110" y="445" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="4. The system shows the record: tour summary, links to the public page and the author's account (UC#21), open reports (reason, note, time, reporter ID), the number of dismissed / resolved reports and the Admin action history. E3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="205" width="320" x="-160" y="565" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="5. The Admin chooses &quot;Hide tour&quot;, enters a reason (required, 1–1000 characters) in the &quot;Hide this tour?&quot; dialog and confirms. A1, A2, A3, E5." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="320" x="-160" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="6. In one transaction, the system moves the tour Public → Hidden, marks the open reports as resolved, clears the counter and the flag, and writes the hide_tour log. E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="175" width="320" x="-160" y="1050" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10" parent="1" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;shapeInside=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="7. The system publishes tour.hidden (and tour.unpublished to remove it from the chatbot); Notification creates a notification and sends an email to the author; the client shows &quot;Tour hidden and the author notified&quot; and reloads the record. E6." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="320" x="-160" y="1285" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="11" parent="1" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#ff0000;" value="" vertex="1">
