        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="13" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E2. No valid token → 401; not an Admin → 403; invalid pagination parameters → 400." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="318" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="14" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E3. Invalid tour ID format → 400; the tour does not exist → 404." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="250" x="355" y="598" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="15" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E5. Missing reason when hiding, or a reason over 1000 characters (hide, restore, dismiss) → 422, the error shows in the dialog." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="250" x="355" y="810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="16" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E4. The status does not allow it (hiding a tour that is not public, restoring a tour that is not hidden, dismissing when no reports are open) → 409; when two Admins act at the same time, only one wins; the client shows the error and reloads the record." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="250" x="355" y="978" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="17" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="E6. A failed event publish is only logged; the decision is still saved." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="250" x="355" y="1310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="18" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.1. The Admin opens the record of a hidden tour (from the action log or the author's account page), chooses &quot;Restore&quot; and confirms &quot;Restore the tour?&quot; (reason optional)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="220" x="-510" y="1020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="19" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;rounded=1;" value="A1.2. The system moves the tour back to Public (no new review), writes the restore_tour log and publishes tour.restored; the author receives a notification and an email &quot;Tour … is visible again&quot;. E4." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="220" x="-510" y="1190" as="geometry" />
